  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://bauval.org https://*.bauval.org https://abscloud.org https://*.abscloud.org; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: https:; frame-src 'self' https://bauval.org https://*.bauval.org https://abscloud.org https://*.abscloud.org; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co https://www.google-analytics.com https://analytics.google.com https://bauval.org https://*.bauval.org https://abscloud.org https://*.abscloud.org; frame-ancestors 'none'

